      "description": "A man with dark skin and visible vitiligo patches on his face, neck, and hand, wearing a green shirt and holding a phone to his ear. His expression appears distressed or pained. The vitiligo is clearly visible as depigmented areas on his skin, contrasting with his darker skin tone.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
